pieces blocked by the SAME binding constraint: EXPLORATION-TO-FIRST-WIN. Unifying session conclusion:
the 0.08 wall is fundamentally a sparse-reward exploration problem; all world-model machinery is
downstream of it and moot until directed exploration / sub-goal discovery is solved -- the real, hard,
open lever (the SOTA-flagged search moat), not a quick win.

